{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "_comment": [
    "Geometry read off the floor plan images and hard-coded on purpose. It",
    "changes about once a decade, so a wrong rectangle is caught once by a",
    "human looking at the map rather than every year by a detector.",
    "VERIFY BEFORE DEPLOYING: open tools/calibrate/index.html, load the room",
    "image, Import this file, and switch to Preview.",
    "",
    "Coordinates are NORMALIZED (0-1) fractions of image_size, so they",
    "survive rescaling the image.",
    "",
    "`desks` are selectable. `features` are decoration: walls, doors, rooms,",
    "windows, partitions and furniture, drawn grey and never clickable. They",
    "exist so a student can tell which desk is by the window and which is",
    "next to the telecom closet.",
    "",
    "Main office zones follow the divider drawn on the plan: desks 1-16",
    "upper-years side, 17-28 first/second-year side, 29-31 upper-years side.",
    "CONFIRM the 29-31 assignment before the first run."
  ],
  "coord_space": "normalized",
  "zones": {
